# Two tracks sounding the same pitch on one channel: one track's
# note-off must not cut the other's note (the off goes out only when
# the last one ends; each note-on is sent, a re-strike). Then a
# repeated pitch within one track: off before on at the same tick.
open virtual
track 1 60:4
  takes over at beat 0.000 (t0)
track 2:1 60:1 r:3
  takes over at beat 0.000 (t0)
play continue
